-1.192 0-2.383.528-3.202 1.295L52.251 62.483h5.225l-37.38-38.169c-.808-.767-1.907-1.295-3.139-1.295-2.549 0-4.496 1.958-4.496 4.496 0 1.254.508 2.32 1.326 3.15l37.822 38.673c.891.953 1.99 1.42 3.275 1.42Z"></path></svg></div></button> </div> <div class="divider svelte-j9g7ud"></div> <section data-test-id="shelf-wrapper" class="shelf svelte-1svznay centered   padding-top padding-bottom"> <p class="svelte-1up5qog"> <div class="multiline-clamp svelte-1r39353" style="--mc-lineClamp: var(--defaultClampOverride, 5);" role="text"> <span class="multiline-clamp__text svelte-1r39353"><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->Stop guessing your next workout. Fitonist is the AI gym workout tracker that builds personalized training plans, logs every set and rep, and adapts each session to the progress you actually make.

Rated 4.8/5 by lifters and powered by AI that learns how you train, Fitonist turns a library of exercises into a focused plan that moves you toward your goal—faster.

SMARTER WORKOUTS, BUILT BY AI
Tell us your goals and preferences, and our AI generates balanced, non-repetitive workouts made for you. Swap any exercise, build a superset, or adjust on the fly—and the AI automatically tunes your next session with the best-matching moves. No two workouts are the same, and every one is built to push you forward.

600+ EXERCISES, REVIEWED BY COACHES
Explore over 600 exercises for every level, each reviewed by professional coaches. Filter by muscle group, search instantly, and save your favorites. Clear video instructions and detailed cues help you perfect your technique on every rep.

TRACK EVERY SET, REP &amp; PR
Logging is effortless. Record your weights and reps in seconds, see your full history for any exercise, and follow smart recommendations to beat your last session. Watch your personal records stack up over time.

SEE YOUR PROGRESS, STAY MOTIVATED
Analyze your weekly goals on clean stats graphs, track calories burned per workout, and make sure every week beats the last. Fitonist syncs with the Health app to keep your data in one place.

WHY LIFTERS CHOOSE FITONIST
• AI-generated workouts that adapt to your progress
• 600+ coach-reviewed exercises with video guides
• Fast set, rep &amp; weight logging with full history
• Supersets, exercise swaps &amp; full workout control
• Weekly stats, calorie tracking &amp; Health app sync
• Built for the gym or home, dumbbells or barbell

Whether you're chasing strength, muscle, or a routine that finally sticks, Fitonist gives you a smarter plan and the tracking to back it up.

Download Fitonist free and start training smarter today. Upgrade to Premium anytime for unlimited AI workouts and full progress insights.

Terms of Use (EULA): https://fitonist.com/terms.html
Privacy Policy: https://fitonist.com/privacy.html<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></span> </div> <button class="svelte-1up5qog">more</button></p> </section> <section id="productRatings" data-test-id="shelf-wrapper" aria-label="Ratings &amp; Reviews" class="shelf svelte-1svznay    padding-top">  <div class="title-action-wrapper svelte-1oivr99">  <a aria-label="Ratings &amp; Reviews" href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/6443644593?see-all=reviews&amp;platform=iphone" data-test-id="internal-link" class="svelte-jrkm1h"><div class="link-contents svelte-1oivr99"><h2 class="shelf-title svelte-1oivr99" data-test-id="shelf-title">Ratings &amp; Reviews</h2> <span class="chevron-container svelte-1oivr99" data-test-id="shelf-see-all-chevron" aria-hidden="true">   <svg viewBox="0 0 51.108 87.687" aria-hidden="false"><path d="M51.108 43.834c-.018-1.997-.718-3.638-2.334-5.23L11.214 1.877C9.974.6 8.453 0 6.64 0 2.96 0 .001 2.897.001 6.55 0 8.326.765 10.004 2.068 11.344l33.398 32.472L2.07 76.325C.784 77.665 0 79.305 0 81.137c0 3.653 2.96 6.55 6.641 6.55 1.796 0 3.334-.601 4.572-1.877l37.561-36.746c1.636-1.591 2.334-3.25 2.334-5.23Z"></path></svg></span></div> </a></div>    <ul style="--grid-max-content-xsmall: 298px; --grid-column-gap-xsmall: 10px; --grid-row-gap-xsmall: 24px; --grid-small: 2; --grid-column-gap-small: 20px; --grid-row-gap-small: 24px; --grid-medium: 2; --grid-column-gap-medium: 20px; --grid-row-gap-medium: 24px; --grid-large: 3; --grid-column-gap-large: 20px; --grid-row-gap-large: 24px; --grid-xlarge: 3; --grid-column-gap-xlarge: 20px; --grid-row-gap-xlarge: 24px;" class="grid svelte-7iyek8" data-test-id="grid"><li><div class="svelte-102wyj3"><div class="amp-rating svelte-z92vmb" data-testid="rating-component"> <div class="stats svelte-z92vmb" role="text"><div class="stats__main svelte-z92vmb" data-testid="amp-rating__average-rating">4.8</div> <div class="stats__total svelte-z92vmb" data-testid="amp-rating__total-text">out of 5</div></div> <div class="numbers svelte-z92vmb"><div