 the screen is still blank. There’s no way for me to look at workouts, try new workouts, do anything like change profile picture great at app, Great first workOut wish I could do more.<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></p> </div>  <div class="developer-response-container svelte-j9szs8"><span class="developer-response-heading svelte-j9szs8">Developer Response</span>   <div class="truncate-wrapper svelte-1b6lxg0"><p data-testid="truncate-text" dir="auto" class="content svelte-1b6lxg0" style="--lines: 1; --line-height: var(--lineHeight, 16); --link-length: 4;"><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->Thank you for the positive feedback about the first workout! We have identified the issue that was causing the screen to be grey. As part of the last release the bug was fixed. Please let us know if you still experience any issues. Feel free to reach out to our email with feedback and propositions - fitonist@fitonist.com Have great day, stay fit and healthy!<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></p> </div> </div></div></div>  <dialog data-testid="dialog" class="svelte-1p01z7" id="" aria-hidden="true"><div data-testid="content-modal" class="content-modal-container svelte-1ih6d3u" dir="auto"><div class="button-container svelte-1ih6d3u"><button data-testid="content-modal-close-button" class="close-button svelte-1ih6d3u" type="button" aria-label="Close"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" aria-hidden="true" data-testid="content-modal-close-button-svg"><path d="M1.2 18C.6 18 0 17.5 0 16.8c0-.4.1-.6.4-.8l7-7-7-7c-.3-.2-.4-.5-.4-.8C0 .5.6 0 1.2 0c.3 0 .6.1.8.3l7 7 7-7c.2-.2.5-.3.8-.3.6 0 1.2.5 1.2 1.2 0 .3-.1.6-.4.8l-7 7 7 7c.2.2.4.5.4.8 0 .7-.6 1.2-1.2 1.2-.3 0-.6-.1-.8-.3l-7-7-7 7c-.2.1-.5.3-.8.3z"></path></svg></button> </div> <div class="header-container svelte-1ih6d3u"><h1 data-testid="content-modal-title" class="title svelte-1ih6d3u">The app shows blank screen after workout</h1> </div> <div class="content-container svelte-1ih6d3u"><div class="container svelte-j9szs8 is-detail-view" aria-labelledby="review-103