8-.78 2.527l5.35 15.374c.026.161.053.188 0 .242-.055.08-.135.026-.243-.054l-12.928-9.864c-.86-.672-1.855-.672-2.715 0l-12.928 9.864c-.107.08-.188.134-.242.054Z"></path></svg> </li><li class="star svelte-1fdd9o7"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 64 64"><path d="M13.559 60.051c1.102.86 2.5.565 4.166-.645l14.218-10.455L46.19 59.406c1.666 1.21 3.037 1.505 4.166.645 1.102-.833 1.344-2.204.672-4.166l-5.618-16.718 14.353-10.32c1.666-1.183 2.338-2.42 1.908-3.764-.43-1.29-1.693-1.935-3.763-1.908l-17.605.108-5.348-16.8C34.308 4.496 33.34 3.5 31.944 3.5c-1.372 0-2.34.995-2.984 2.984L23.61 23.283l-17.605-.108c-2.07-.027-3.333.618-3.763 1.908-.457 1.344.242 2.58 1.909 3.763l14.352 10.321-5.617 16.718c-.672 1.962-.43 3.333.672 4.166Zm3.87-5.321c-.054-.054-.027-.081 0-.242l5.349-15.374c.376-1.049.161-1.882-.78-2.527L8.613 27.341c-.134-.08-.161-.134-.134-.215.027-.08.08-.08.242-.08l16.26.295c1.103.027 1.802-.43 2.151-1.532l4.677-15.562c.027-.162.08-.215.134-.215.08 0 .135.053.162.215l4.676 15.562c.35 1.102 1.048 1.559 2.15 1.532l16.261-.296c.162 0 .216 0 .243.081.027.08-.027.134-.135.215l-13.385 9.246c-.94.645-1.156 1.478-.78 2.527l5.35 15.374c.026.161.053.188 0 .242-.055.08-.135.026-.243-.054l-12.928-9.864c-.86-.672-1.855-.672-2.715 0l-12.928 9.864c-.107.08-.188.134-.242.054Z"></path></svg> </li> </ol></div></div> <div class="review-header svelte-j9szs8"><time class="date svelte-j9szs8" datetime="2023-09-22T18:58:41.000Z">09/22/2023</time>  <div class="multiline-clamp svelte-1r39353" style="--mc-lineClamp: var(--defaultClampOverride, 1);" role="text"> <span class="multiline-clamp__text svelte-1r39353"><span class="author svelte-j9szs8">Jaydel500</span></span> </div></div></div> <p><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->After completing 1st work out, the app shut down wouldn’t let me log back in after two days of trying to log back in and successfully on the second day my data was deleted and the screen is still blank. There’s no way for me to look at workouts, try new workouts, do anything like change profile picture great at app, Great first workOut wish I could do more.<!-- HTML_TAG_END --> <div class="developer-response-container svelte-j9szs8"><div class="developer-response-header svelte-j9szs8"><span class="developer-response-heading svelte-j9szs8">Developer Response</span> <time class="date svelte-j9szs8" datetime="2023-10-05T07:58:21.000Z">10/05/2023</time></div> <!-- HTML_TAG_START -->Thank you for the positive feedback about the first workout! We have identified the issue that was causing the screen to be grey. As part of the last release the bug was fixed. Please let us know if you still experience any issues. Feel free to reach out to our email with feedback and propositions - fitonist@fitonist.com Have great day, stay fit and healthy!<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></div></p></div> </div> </div> </dialog> </div></li>   <li class="shelf-grid__list-item svelte-13b6ljx" data-test-id="shelf-grid-list-item-2" data-index="2" aria-hidden="true"><div class="svelte-13b6ljx"><div class="container svelte-j9szs8" aria-labelledby="review-9266857333-title" dir="ltr"><div class="header svelte-j9szs8"><div class="title-and-rating-container svelte-j9szs8"> <div class="multiline-clamp svelte-1r39353" style="--mc-lineClamp: var(--defaultClampOverride, 1);" role="text"> <span class="multiline-clamp__text svelte-1r39353"><h3 id="review-9266857333-title" class="title svelte-j9szs8">Amazing app!</h3></span> </div> <div style="display: contents; --fill-color:var(--systemOrange); --star-size:12px;"><ol class="stars svelte-1fdd9o7" aria-label="5 Stars"><li class="star svelte-1fdd9o7"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 64 64"><path d="M13.559 60.051c1.102.86 2.5.565 4.166-.645l14.218-10.455L46.19 59.406c1.666 1.21 3.037 1.505 4.166.645 1.102-.833 1.344-2.204.672-4.166l-5.618-16.718 14.353-10.32c1.666-1.183 2.338-2.42 1.908-3.764-.43-1.29-1.693-1.935-3.763-1.908l-17.605.108-5.348-16.8C34.308 4.496 33.34 3.5 31.944 3.5c-1.372 0-2.34.995-2.984 2.984L23.61 23.283l-17.605-.108c-2.07-.027-3.333