s="container detail  svelte-1t5dyc5"><div class="inner svelte-1t5dyc5"><p class="svelte-1t5dyc5">  <span class="svelte-epwvmp"><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->This update makes Fitonist smoother when training with Apple Watch:

- Heart rate in the app: See your heart rate in Fitonist when connected to Apple Watch.
- Watch improvements: More reliable workout metrics, tracking, and rest timer syncing.
- Workout fixes: Fixed an issue where older unfinished workouts could stay stuck.
- More improvements: General cleanup and stability improvements across the app.

Thanks for training with Fitonist! Leave us a review or reach out anytime.<!-- HTML_TAG_END --> </span></p> <div class="metadata svelte-1t5dyc5"><span class="svelte-1t5dyc5">1.150</span> <time datetime="2026-07-11" class="svelte-1t5dyc5">Jul 11</time></div></div> </div> </li><li><div class="container detail  svelte-1t5dyc5"><div class="inner svelte-1t5dyc5"><p class="svelte-1t5dyc5">  <span class="svelte-epwvmp"><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->This update brings clearer workout guidance, richer workout summaries, and smoother Watch support:

- Exercise instructions: Get helpful guidance for exercises right from your workout.
- Exercise preferences: Favorite exercises you like and exclude ones you want to avoid.
- Workout insights: Review heart rate charts after finished workouts.
- Watch improvements: Smoother workout tracking, syncing, and rest timers.
