 Perfect Workout Plan\n\nWhether you want to lose weight, build muscle, or tone up, we’ll match you with a customized plan that fits your goals, fitness level, and schedule. Home or gym? Strength or HIIT? You decide!\n\n\n\nStep 3: Crush Your Workouts & Stay Motivated\n\nFollow along with easy-to-learn exercises and coaches who keep you pumped every step of the way. Plus, you can track progress with Apple Health and sync your Apple Watch for real-time stats.\n\nWhy Oomph?\n-Personalized Workouts for home & gym\n-Strength, HIIT, Booty, Boxing & More\n-AI-Powered Food Logging – just snap & track\n-Workout Flexibility – choose duration & intensity\n-Sync with Apple Health to track calories & activity\n\nTry Oomph Today!\nDownload now and start your fitness journey made simple!\n\nPrivacy Policy: https://oomphfitness.com/privacy-policy\nTerms of Service: https://oomphfitness.com/terms-of-service","rating":4.7,"ratingCount":"923","buttonAction":{"title":"Get","presentationStyle":[],"actionMetrics":{"$kind":"ActionMetrics","data":[{"fields":{"reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","actionDetails":{"buyParams":"productType=C&price=0&salableAdamId=1476284055&pricingParameters=STDQ&pg=default&appExtVrsId=873902252"},"location":[{"locationPosition":0,"locationType":"button","name":"Get","reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","idType":"its_id","id":"1476284055"},{"locationPosition":0,"locationType":"lockup","name":"Oomph: AI Nutrition & Workouts","reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","idType":"its_id","id":"1476284055"},{"locationPosition":15,"locationType":"similarItems","name":"You Might Also Like","idType":"relationship","id":"customers-also-bought-apps"}],"jet_adamId":"1476284055","eventType":"click","targetType":"button","targetId":"1476284055","platformContext":"iphone","alt_ab2_data":"[]"},"includingFields":["impressionsSnapshot","pageFields","contentRestrictionReasons","appState"],"excludingFields":["