ature for accurate measurement and follow the step-by-step instructions. Take control of your fitness journey and download our app now! Transform your body and achieve the perfect booty.\n\nRead more about our terms and conditions below.\n\nPrivacy Policy:\nhttps://docs.google.com/document/d/1rM86R0C-qNfgutStpdzcud8GTI7wZxLY4fGcr5m3Gsw/edit?usp=sharing\n\nTerms of Use:\nhttps://docs.google.com/document/d/110AqbURY-zISI-VEydGc41peoZZ7XkVFYjG7Ha4umk4/edit?usp=sharing\n\nContact:\nfatihburay810@gmail.com\n\n*Pricing in countries may vary and actual charges may be converted to your local currency depending on the country of residence.\n*Payment will be charged to iTunes Account at confirmation of purchase.\n*Subscription will be automatically renewed. Auto-renew can be turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period.\n*Your account will be charged for renewal within 24 hours prior to the end of the current period, and identify the cost of the renewal.\n*Subscriptions may be managed by you and auto-renewal may be turned off by going to the user's iTunes Account Settings.\n\nFor more information please visit one of the following links:\n- https://support.apple.com/en-us/HT202039\n- https://support.apple.com/en-us/HT204084","rating":4.7,"ratingCount":"106","buttonAction":{"title":"Get","presentationStyle":[],"actionMetrics":{"$kind":"ActionMetrics","data":[{"fields":{"reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","actionDetails":{"buyParams":"productType=C&price=0&salableAdamId=6445967560&pricingParameters=STDQ&pg=default&appExtVrsId=861368991"},"location":[{"locationPosition":0,"locationType":"button","name":"Get","reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","idType":"its_id","id":"6445967560"},{"locationPosition":1,"locationType":"lockup","name":"Heart Rate Monitor: Pulse App・","reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","idType":"its_id","id":"6445967560"},{"locationPosition":15,"locationType":"similarI