en":0.9058823529411765,"blue":0.9411764705882353,"type":"rgb"},"style":"roundedRectPrerendered","crop":"bb","contentMode":null,"imageScale":null,"template":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/d8/60/0c/d8600c74-b071-f4a2-bac5-b8d2499888ea/Placeholder.mill/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}","width":1024,"height":1024,"variants":[{"$kind":"ArtworkVariant","format":"jpeg","quality":70,"supportsWideGamut":false}]},"title":"PAIRS Yodi Relationship Coach","isIOSBinaryMacOSCompatible":true,"useAdsLocale":false,"subtitle":"Powerful, Practical, Usable","tertiaryTitle":"Designed for iPad","tertiaryTitleAction":null,"tertiaryTitleArtwork":null,"developerTagline":"Powerful, Practical, Usable","ageRating":"18+","productDescription":"Love is a skill—and with Yodi, you can learn it.\n\nDeveloped by the PAIRS Foundation, Yodi brings decades of clinical research and proven relationship psychology directly to your pocket. Whether you’re looking to deepen your bond, navigate conflict, or build a foundation for a new relationship, Yodi provides the structure and support you need to thrive.\n\nTrusted by therapists, educators, veterans, and over a quarter-million families nationwide, Yodi makes practicing essential relationship skills simple, accessible, and effective—anytime, anywhere.\n\nWHY YODI?\n\nRelationships don’t come with a manual, but Yodi is the next best thing. Built on the world-renowned Practical Application of Intimate Relationship Skills (PAIRS) curriculum, this app turns complex psychology into simple, daily habits that transform how you connect with those who matter most.\n\nKEY FEATURES:\n\nDaily Temperature Reading (DTR): Our signature 5-step ritual designed to boost intimacy, reduce daily friction, and build unshakable trust.\n\nThe Emotional Jug: A safe, structured way to clear the air, express hidden feelings, and feel truly heard by your partner.\n\nFair Fight for Change: Stop the cycle of circular arguments. Learn a proven roadmap to turn disagreements into collaborative breakthroughs.\n\nTalking Tips: Never feel \"stuck\" for words again. Use our guided prompts to communicate your needs safely and clearly.\n\nGuided Micro-Coaching: Quick, powerful lessons on the go that help you master PAIRS skills in just minutes a day.\n\nProgress Tracking & Reminders: Stay consistent with helpful nudges and see your relationship health grow over time.\n\nWHO IS YODI FOR?\n\nCouples wanting to move from \"roommates\" back to soulmates.\n\nIndividuals looking to build healthier emotional habits.\n\nCo-parents striving for clearer, conflict-free communication.\n\nVeterans and Families seeking to strengthen bonds and resilience.\n\nDon’t leave your closest relationships to chance. Join the hundreds of thousands of people who have used PAIRS to transform their lives.\n\nDownload Yodi for free today. Love better. Live more connected.","rating":4.4,"ratingCount":"20","buttonAction":{"title":"Get","presentationStyle":[],"actionMetrics":{"$kind":"ActionMetrics","data":[{"fields":{"reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","actionDetails":{"buyParams":"productType=C&price=0&salableAdamId=6464098174&pricingParameters=STDQ&pg=default&appExtVrsId=888880396"},"location":[{"locationPosition":0,"locationType":"button","name":"Get","reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","idType":"its_id","id":"6464098174"},{"locationPosition":8,"locationType":"lockup","name":"PAIRS Yodi Relationship Coach","reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","idType":"its_id","id":"6464098174"},{"locationPosition":15,"locationType":"similarItems","name":"You Might Also Like","idType":"relationship","id":"customers-also-bought-apps"}],"jet_adamId":"6464098174","eventType":"click","targetType":"button","targetId":"6464098174","platformContext":"iphone","alt_ab2_data":"[]"},"includingFields":["impressionsSnapshot","pageFields","contentRestrictionReasons","appState"],"excludingFields":["amsMetricsID"],"topic":"xp_amp